# Workspace Rules

## Project
- **OpenClaw** — this is our workspace; we are working on **clawbot**.
- Architecture: WhatsApp-first control plane, Apple Notes as system memory; see `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Multi-agent orchestration (hub, agents, skills, infra): `docs/MULTI_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE.md` + `docs/multi_agent_graph.yaml`.

## Scripts and tools
- Prefer **PowerShell**, **Python**, and **Node.js** when possible.
- Prefer **combining scripts into one** when it makes sense.
- **Do not change or delete working scripts** without explicit approval.
- Before deleting or changing existing behavior, **ask for user approval**.

## General
- Run scripts when relevant to verify or demonstrate behavior.
- Keep changes minimal and avoid breaking existing behavior.
